# Node: direct closed calculation; exact rational log
# Before (rejected by the baseline release):
# log(4,2)=1/2
# Former behavior: JSON success=false and process exit 1.
# Now: the same assertion and its exact eval are supported.
# Boundary: false results and ill-defined inputs still reject; see
# examples/negative/closed_exact_elementary_calculation/.
# Run: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/closed_rational_log_calculation.lit

log(4,2)=1/2
log(8,4)=2/3
log(1/3,27)=-3
log(4,1/8)=-3/2
log(4/9,8/27)=3/2
log(2/3,9/4)=-2
log(1/3,1)=0
log(1/3,1/3)=1
log(100,10)=1/2
log(4,2)+log(8,4)=7/6
eval log(8,4)
eval log(1/3,27)
